# raw FDTDX phasor dumps and resume checkpoints are large (tens of MB per run) and are regenerated by fx_run.py;
# the derived deliverables (normalized fields at the analysis wavelengths, spectra, profiles, slices, manifests,
# run_meta.json) are committed, following the fdtdx_four_finalists convention
*/raw_fields/*/phasors.npz
*/raw_fields/*/state.npz
*/raw_fields/*/*.tmp.npz
reference/*/phasors.npz
reference/*/state.npz
*/rho_hard_binary.npy
__pycache__/
*/raw_fields/fields_normalized_H.npz
